From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:55:06 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 34/45] inkling2: TF_INKLING2_DRAFT_WEIGHTS=nvfp4 quantises the
 drafter's projections at load

The bundled DSpark drafter is released in bf16 and its five layers'
projections are most of a draft pass's bytes. NVFP4 by round to
nearest (ModelOpt's layout, one global scale a matrix) through the
lane matmul's existing fp4 mode. The target checks every draft, so it
moves acceptance, never output. bf16 stays the default until measured.
---
